{"type":"message","id":"37976bb9","parentId":"c8041159","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:05:08.976Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_hbki144v8nqs_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"================================================================================\nBrotli Compression Performance Benchmark\n================================================================================\n\nBenchmarking: small-html (46 bytes)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrotli (best ratio: level 11):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 134.63ms | Throughput: 0 MB/s\nGzip (best ratio: level 9):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 1.25ms | Throughput: 0.04 MB/s\nBrotli advantage: +NaN% compression ratio\n\nBenchmarking: medium-json (3845 bytes)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrotli (best ratio: level 11):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 1.37ms | Throughput: 2.67 MB/s\nGzip (best ratio: level 9):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 0.22ms | Throughput: 16.55 MB/s\nBrotli advantage: +NaN% compression ratio\n\nBenchmarking: large-css (3349 bytes)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrotli (best ratio: level 11):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 0.88ms | Throughput: 3.62 MB/s\nGzip (best ratio: level 9):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 0.09ms | Throughput: 34.94 MB/s\nBrotli advantage: +NaN% compression ratio\n\nBenchmarking: large-js (7099 bytes)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrotli (best ratio: level 11):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 1.33ms | Throughput: 5.1 MB/s\nGzip (best ratio: level 9):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 0.18ms | Throughput: 37.38 MB/s\nBrotli advantage: +NaN% compression ratio\n\nBenchmarking: html-with-markdown (1658 bytes)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrotli (best ratio: level 11):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 0.90ms | Throughput: 1.76 MB/s\nGzip (best ratio: level 9):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 0.13ms | Throughput: 11.93 MB/s\nBrotli advantage: +NaN% compression ratio\n\n================================================================================\nSummary - Compression Ratios by Content Type\n================================================================================\n\nContent Type        Brotli (level 6)    Gzip (level 6)      Advantage\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsmall-html          NaN% (44B)          NaN% (57B)          +NaN%\nmedium-json         NaN% (88B)          NaN% (119B)         +NaN%\nlarge-css           NaN% (59B)          NaN% (113B)         +NaN%\nlarge-js            NaN% (71B)          NaN% (125B)         +NaN%\nhtml-with-markdown  NaN% (79B)          NaN% (106B)         +NaN%\n\n================================================================================\nRecommendations\n================================================================================\n\n1. Use Brotli quality level 6 for best balance of compression and speed\n2. Brotli typically provides 15-25% better compression than gzip\n3. For static assets (CSS/JS), use Brotli level 9 for maximum compression\n4. For dynamic content, use Brotli level 4-6 to minimize latency\n5. Ensure proper Cache-Control headers are set for compressible content"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2089,"aggregated":"================================================================================\nBrotli Compression Performance Benchmark\n================================================================================\n\nBenchmarking: small-html (46 bytes)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrotli (best ratio: level 11):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 134.63ms | Throughput: 0 MB/s\nGzip (best ratio: level 9):\n  Compression: NaN% | Time: 1.25ms | Throughput: 0.04 MB/s\nBrotli advantage: +NaN% compression ratio\n\nBenchmarking: medium-json (3845 bytes)\n----------------------------