{"type":"message","id":"c5928dab","parentId":"dc1baa70","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:06:18.892Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_dmub2jcfah6j_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"================================================================================\n        BROTLI COMPRESSION PERFORMANCE BENCHMARK\n================================================================================\n\nNode.js version: v25.4.0\nDate: 2026-02-13T08:06:18.854Z\n\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: small-html (Original: 114 B)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (79 B), 0.319ms, 348.54 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (107 B), 0.175ms, 636.01 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (73 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (107 B)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: medium-json (Original: 3.98 KB)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (104 B), 0.181ms, 21929.92 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (140 B), 0.135ms, 29436 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (97 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (140 B)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: large-css (Original: 200 B)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (10 B), 0.079ms, 2481.48 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (24 B), 0.086ms, 2266.7 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (11 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (24 B)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: large-js (Original: 90.33 KB)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (144 B), 0.335ms, 269981.01 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (549 B), 0.49ms, 184380.32 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (142 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (549 B)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: html-markdown (Original: 14.06 KB)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (112 B), 0.157ms, 89486.38 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (206 B), 0.145ms, 96857.74 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (109 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (206 B)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: api-response (Original: 17.60 KB)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (103 B), 0.135ms, 130470.36 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (204 B), 0.183ms, 96364.62 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (116 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (204 B)\n\n\n================================================================================\n                        SUMMARY TABLE\n================================================================================\n\nContent Type      Original      Brotli (L6)       Gzip (L6)     Savings\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nsmall-html        114 B         NaN%      79 B    NaN%      107 B+NaN%\nmedium-json       3.98 KB       NaN%      104 B   NaN%      140 B+NaN%\nlarge-css         200 B         NaN%      10 B    NaN%      24 B+NaN%\nlarge-js          90.33 KB      NaN%      144 B   NaN%      549 B+NaN%\nhtml-markdown     14.06 KB      NaN%      112 B   NaN%      206 B+NaN%\napi-response      17.60 KB      NaN%      103 B   NaN%      204 B+NaN%\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nTOTAL             126.28 KB     99.6%     552 B   99.0%     1.20 KB+0.6%\n\n\n================================================================================\n                        RECOMMENDATIONS\n================================================================================\n\n1. Brotli compression provides ~0.6% better compression than gzip\n2. Recommended settings:\n   ├── Dynamic content: Brotli quality 4-6 (balance speed/compression)\n   ├── Static assets:   Brotli quality 9 (maximum compression)\n   └── Fallback:       Gzip level 6 (for older clients)\n\n3. Memory considerations:\n   ├── Brotli level 6: ~512 KB buffer\n   ├── Brotli level 11: ~1 MB buffer\n   └── Monitor memory usage in production\n\n4. Cache headers:\n   ├── Static assets: max-age=31536000 (immutable)\n   ├── HTML pages:    max-age=300 (with stale-while-revalidate)\n   └── API responses: no-store\n\n5. Threshold: Compress only responses > 1 KB\n\nResults exported to: compression-benchmark-results.json"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":134,"aggregated":"================================================================================\n        BROTLI COMPRESSION PERFORMANCE BENCHMARK\n================================================================================\n\nNode.js version: v25.4.0\nDate: 2026-02-13T08:06:18.854Z\n\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSample: small-html (Original: 114 B)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  Level 6 Comparison (recommended):\n  ├── Brotli: NaN% compression (79 B), 0.319ms, 348.54 KB/s\n  └── Gzip:   NaN% compression (107 B), 0.175ms, 636.01 KB/s\n\n  Best Compression:\n  ├── Brotli level 11: NaN% (73 B)\n  └── Gzip level 9:   NaN% (107 B)\n\n──────────